                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ka ikaa wunu cam ame oceki lobowu, myero kur ika wunu yi poto luŋ aluŋa tuno naka i laŋete, dok daŋ kur irarao wunu en obwoto waŋwu i kare me kac. Magi-nono ibino wunu weko me konyo ocan kede orok; an a Rwot Obaŋawu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.22"
            ]
          }
        }
